==German==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|de|ab-|decken}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|afdekken||to cover}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈapˌdɛkən/|[ˈʔapˌdɛkən]|[-kŋ̩]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-abdecken.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|deckt ab|deckte ab|abgedeckt}}

# to [[cover]]
#: {{ux|de|Ich muss noch die Leiche '''abdecken'''.|inline=1|Now I have to cover the corpse.}}
# to [[cover]] costs
#: {{ux|de|Das '''deckt''' kaum die Kosten '''ab'''.|inline=1|That barely covers the costs.}}
# to [[uncover]], [[untile]]
#: {{ux|de|Der Sturm '''deckte''' die Dächer '''ab'''.|inline=1|The storm uncovered the roofs.}}

